{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","src":"manifest","doc":"BSWModuleDescriptionTemplate","page":258,"text":"13.2.6 ECU State Manager Service Needs\nThe meta-class EcuStateMgrUserNeeds is used to define the requirements to con-\nfigure the ECU State Manager Service. There are actually two variants of AUTOSAR\nECU management: flexible and fixed. An BswInternalBehavior may provide sev-\neral EcuStateMgrUserNeeds elements where each defines the requirements from\none “user” of the EcuM Service (for the terms related to the AUTOSAR ECU State\nManager see [26]).","caption":"13.2.6 ECU State Manager Service Needs","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":252,"hash":"9ded23701eda6151","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/1f2ec98d930e/page_252.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","releases":["R19-11"],"page":245,"hash":"5ba7c540a9e859ba","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/25cb007886c5/page_245.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","releases":["R20-11"],"page":242,"hash":"6ee0124ec44b8dde","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/51bb8c0169fb/page_242.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","releases":["R21-11"],"page":240,"hash":"330800d14008a6e1","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d4a6e197e0d7/page_240.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_6_ECU_State_Manager_Service_Needs","releases":["R22-11"],"page":258,"hash":"f0c0553f52105325","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/b5efb07ed854/page_258.webp"}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","4.3.1"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/s